        <title type="html"><![CDATA[Correct Chromium inter-character ruby support]]></title>
        <id>https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/31005</id>
        <link href="https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/31005"/>
        <updated>2026-10-31T22:04:07.000Z</updated>
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<img src="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/128292743?u=3e557f09456339e289afa5d06625e4c955e0a4e6&v=4" width="64" height="64" alt=""/><br/><h4 dir="auto">Summary</h4>
<p dir="auto">Marks <code class="notranslate">ruby-position: inter-character</code> as unsupported in Chrome and removes the inaccurate prefixed-support note. Mirrored Chromium-based entries follow the existing data model.</p>
<h4 dir="auto">Test results and supporting details</h4>
<ul dir="auto">
<li>Chromium's <a href="https://github.com/chromium/chromium/blob/fb096c0011f9d50f0a264a9376420cdea9c421e3/third_party/blink/renderer/core/css/properties/longhands/longhands_custom.cc">current parser</a> accepts <code class="notranslate">over</code> and <code class="notranslate">under</code> and rejects <code class="notranslate">inter-character</code>. The <a href="https://github.com/chromium/chromium/blob/84.0.4147.89/third_party/blink/renderer/core/css/css_properties.json5">Chrome 84 property definitions</a> list only <code class="notranslate">before</code> and <code class="notranslate">after</code> for the prefixed property.</li>
<li>Formatting and data lint passed on an isolated older repository snapshot with the same changed file. The unit tests passed with equivalent PowerShell environment variables; <code class="notranslate">npm test</code> itself stopped on Windows because its unit-test script uses Unix environment-variable syntax.</li>
<li>I did not run browser tests.</li>
</ul>
<p dir="auto">Prepared with Codex assistance.</p>
<h4 dir="auto">Related issues</h4>
<p dir="auto"><span class="issue-keyword tooltipped tooltipped-se" aria-label="This pull request closes issue #30993.">Fixes</span> <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="6086054917" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/30993" data-hovercard-type="issue" data-hovercard-url="/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/30993/hovercard" href="https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/30993">#30993</a>.</p>]]></content>
